WEBVTT

00:12:58.941 --> 00:13:03.320
They're the ones who are doing
the conservation, not you and me.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.239
(Applause)

00:13:08.784 --> 00:13:11.411
Once we do that --

00:13:12.496 --> 00:13:13.872
Notice what it is.

00:13:13.914 --> 00:13:16.708
It's a win for nature.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:19.211
It's a win for the economy.

00:13:19.253 --> 00:13:20.712
The government will make money

00:13:20.754 --> 00:13:23.382
because the government
is going to get all that revenue.

00:13:23.423 --> 00:13:25.050
It will change its fiscal stance.

00:13:25.092 --> 00:13:29.096
It will diversify its economy.
It will grow in a sustainable way.